, and survive the horrors lurking in his mansion-turned-laboratory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to step into the darkness? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316350/extras/08b9616f92e2fc434a31c44f8246069a.avif?t=1759736758\" width=616 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316350/extras/7cb9afe0964305e7029cfabf225b7302.poster.avif?t=1759736758\" width=800 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316350/extras/7cb9afe0964305e7029cfabf225b7302.webm?t=1759736758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316350/extras/7cb9afe0964305e7029cfabf225b7302.mp4?t=1759736758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Survival Horror Meets Modern Innovations</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fixed and Dynamic Camera Angles</strong>: Relive the tension of classic fixed perspectives, seamlessly blending into modern rail and follow camera dynamics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Saves</strong>: Strategically save your progress using collectible items.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory Management</strong>: Tactically manage limited inventory slots with access to safe room storage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-Driven Narrative</strong>: Engage with intricate puzzles intertwined with the story, unlocking hidden secrets and new areas.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 